Title: Dinosaur Buys Bread
Credit: Level B animated short — no character dialogue; narrator only

INT. FAMILY HOUSE INTERIOR (familyhouse_interior) - DAY

WIDE ESTABLISHING: Warm, wood-walled cottage interior in soft natural light. Low shelves with simple ceramics and woven baskets line the walls. A small window lets in sunbeams that pick up dust motes.

CENTER FRAME: Dinosaur, a small friendly green dinosaur, stands upright beside a low table. His belly gives an exaggerated, silent wobble to suggest hunger. His big eyes glance to the table, then to a bread basket on a shelf.

CAMERA: SLOW DOLLY IN as Dinosaur touches his belly with both hands and looks hopefully toward the basket.

NARRATOR
ὁ δεινόσαυρος ἐν τῇ οἰκίᾳ ἐστίν.

CLOSE ON: Dinosaur’s face brightens, then he tiptoes to the shelf.

NARRATOR
πεινᾷ· θέλει φαγεῖν τὸν ἄρτον.

ACTION DETAIL: He reaches up on tiptoe, lifts the lid of the bread basket, and peers inside. The basket is empty. His shoulders sink. He checks a jar, then a second basket—both empty. He opens a tiny cupboard; a moth flutters out comically and escapes past his snout.

NARRATOR
ζητεῖ τὸν ἄρτον, ἀλλ’ οὐκ ἔστιν ὁ ἄρτος ἐν τῇ οἰκίᾳ.

CAMERA: ANGLE WIDENS to include the door and his small travel pouch hanging on a peg.

Dinosaur glances to the pouch, nods with resolve, and slings it across his chest.

NARRATOR
δεῖ ἀγοράζειν τὸν ἄρτον· δεῖ πορεύεσθαι εἰς τὴν ἀγοράν.

He pads to the door, looks back once at the empty basket, then turns the latch.

CUT TO BLACK.
END SCENE.


EXT. FAMILY HOUSE EXTERIOR (familyhouse_exterior) - DAY

BRIGHT SUNLIGHT: A cozy cottage with terracotta roof tiles and a garden path of small cobblestones. Sunflowers and lavender sway. Butterflies drift through the frame.

The door opens; Dinosaur steps out, adjusts his little pouch, and inhales the sunny day with a hopeful smile.

CAMERA: LOW FOLLOW as he closes the door gently, checks the pouch, and pats a small coin bundle inside, hearing a soft jingle.

NARRATOR
ὁ δεινόσαυρος ἐξέρχεται ἐκ τῆς οἰκίας.

He looks down the winding path that leads toward the town. He takes a confident first step.

NARRATOR
πορεύεται ἐν τῇ ὁδῷ εἰς τὴν ἀγοράν.

CUT ON ACTION as he starts walking.
END SCENE.


EXT. FAMILY HOUSE EXTERIOR — SHADE TREE AND PATH (familyhouse_exterior_tree) - DAY

WIDE: The cottage now small in the background. A friendly shade tree frames the winding path. Leaves flicker in sunlight; a pair of robins hop along low branches.

CAMERA: TRACKING LEFT with Dinosaur as he walks, arms swinging in a steady rhythm. He passes under the tree, dapples of light moving across his back.

He pauses to let a squirrel scamper across the path, then continues, following the curve toward town.

CAMERA: MATCH CUT on his feet stepping from cobblestone to smooth limestone.

CUT TO:
END SCENE.


EXT. AGORA EXTERIOR (agora_exterior) - DAY

ESTABLISHING: Classic Doric columns in chalk white ring a sunlit stoa. Terracotta roof tiles glow warm; small laurel shrubs flank low steps. Sparrows hop on the stylobate; a friendly cat naps in shade.

CAMERA: PUSH IN as Dinosaur arrives from frame left, climbs the stylobate steps, and looks up, impressed by the calm, ordered space.

He passes a terracotta amphora, the bronze rings on his pouch softly chiming with each step. A light sea breeze stirs fabric ties in Aegean blue.

NARRATOR
ἥκει εἰς τὴν ἀγοράν ὁ δεινόσαυρος.

Dinosaur turns toward the shaded colonnade opening and steps within.

NARRATOR
εἰσέρχεται εἰς τὴν στοάν.
END SCENE.


INT. AGORA INTERIOR (agora_interior) - DAY

SOFT DAYLIGHT: A covered stoa with sturdy Doric columns and terracotta-tiled floor. Low cedar benches line the walls; neat white tables stand in rows. A tidy reading mat area sits at one end.

WIDE DOWN THE COLONNADE: A single market table ahead displays goods. Behind it stands Emporos, a stout, kind-eyed merchant with a striped himation over a brown chiton. His coin pouches and small tools hang from a wide leather belt.

On the table: a fresh loaf of bread (round, scored top), a pile of shiny red-green apples in a woven basket, and a simple blue-rimmed jug of water with a cup.

CAMERA: SLOW DOLLY FORWARD with Dinosaur as he walks straight along the central walkway, keeping his steps light and purposeful.

NARRATOR
περιπατεῖ πρὸς τὸν ἔμπορον.

CUT TO: MEDIUM ON TABLE as Emporos straightens the loaf and apples to neat rows. He glances up warmly at Dinosaur.

NARRATOR
ὁ ἔμπορος πωλεῖ τὸν ἄρτον καὶ τὰ μῆλα καὶ τὸ ὕδωρ· ἔχει τὰ ἀγαθὰ καλῶς.

CLOSE ON: Dinosaur’s hopeful face as he points to the bread with a polite nod.

NARRATOR
βούλεται ἀγοράζειν τὸν ἄρτον ὁ δεινόσαυρος· δεῖ δοῦναι τὰ νομίσματα.

INSERT: Dinosaur opens his pouch, carefully counts with his fingers, then sets neat bronze and silver coins upon the table in a small stack.

SOUND DESIGN NOTE: No spoken dialogue; coins clink softly.

NARRATOR
δίδωσι τῷ ἐμπορῷ τὰ νομίσματα ὁ δεινόσαυρος.

Emporos smiles, checks the coins quickly with practiced fingers, then lifts the loaf with both hands and offers it forward.

NARRATOR
δίδωσιν ὁ ἔμπορος τῷ δεινοσαύρῳ τὸν ἄρτον.

CAMERA: OVER-SHOULDER FROM DINOSAUR as small green hands receive the round loaf. He hugs it briefly in delight, then sits on a nearby low cedar bench within the colonnade.

NARRATOR
δεῖ φαγεῖν τὸν ἄρτον· ὁ δεινόσαυρος νῦν δύναται φαγεῖν.

CLOSE ON: Dinosaur breaks the loaf; soft crumbs fall. He takes a big, happy bite. His eyes close contentedly. He chews and swallows with a satisfied sigh.

NARRATOR
ἐσθίει τὸν ἄρτον ὁ δεινόσαυρος· οὐκέτι πεινᾷ.

WIDE: Calm interior of the stoa, merchant folding a cloth, sparrows hopping near the far column; Dinosaur finishes another bite, feet swinging gently above the terracotta tiles.

HOLD the peaceful tableau a beat.

FADE OUT.
END SCENE.